modified_at
access_groups
content_hash
embedding_model_version
pipeline_run_id
```

## 21.3 Incremental Document Processing

Avoid re-embedding everything.

Possible process:

```text
Calculate content hash
    ↓
Compare with previous hash
    ↓
Unchanged → skip
Changed   → reparse, rechunk, re-embed, reindex
Deleted   → remove from index
```

## 21.4 Embedding Versioning

If the embedding model changes:

```text
Old and new vectors may not be comparable.
```

Track:

- Embedding model
- Model version
- Vector dimensions
- Chunking version
- Processing timestamp

## 21.5 Index Consistency

Potential failure:

```text
Delta table updated
but
search index update failed
```

Mitigations:

- Track index status
- Retry idempotently
- Reconciliation job
- Version index builds
- Blue-green index replacement for major changes

